          "PlanIntegrityResultV1 and frontier parser",
          "Repository opt-in mode and adoption floor",
          "Coordinated and release plan-start admission before mutation",
          "Direct plan-bound claim admission against the exact Git start revision",
          "One full start-revision custody across readiness, claim, worktree creation, and session upsert",
